ailable on apple music and spotify  links should be in the description below  you should already know 30 of the songs  i've used them in this video but there's  plenty others from albums that didn't  make the list a lot of great music and i  hope you guys have a chance to check  that out and let me know what you do  enjoy i'd love to hear from you you know  what were your favorite albums of the  year what really moved you this year  it's crazy to think that i didn't even  have this channel a year ago 12 months  ago i didn't even exist and now there's  tens of thousands of you who are  watching this and that just  it's really cool thank you guys for  sticking around the 10 second reviews  will be back next year but yeah i hope  you guys had a good restful holidays  spend some time with your family and  let's keep it going  [Music]

